clauses.quote:
We encourage applications from the following entities registered in the United States or Tunisia, 
with at least two years of programming experience. (Proposals must include documentation 
demonstrating the applying organization’s experience.)
• Not-for-profit organizations, including think tanks and civil society/non-governmental 
organizations;
• Public and private educational institutions;
• Non-profit or governmental educational institutions;
• Governmental institutions; and
• Individuals may also apply;
